ImageSeek substantially changes the original interaction model into a low-permission Android reverse-image-search application centered on system photo/file selection and Android image sharing. The current implementation adds a seven-engine search flow, temporary image hosting with retry/fallback handling, image re-encoding, upload reuse within the current app session, hardened WebView settings, and Android 16-oriented behavior.

